WEBVTT

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:12.570
<b>I tried coming alone to our usual park.</b>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.070
<b>It's a feeling I've never felt.</b>

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:21.660
<b>Like a child, frightened by the sound of the wind</b>

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.670
<b>I ran back along the path home.</b>

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.970
<b>The sky outside the window is too vast. Where are you now?</b>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.130
<b>Please, may this reach you...</b>

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:44.690
<b>Dear Lord, if you ever grant wishes,</b>

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:50.110
<b>grant my wish right now, please!</b>

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>I want to hear your voice, I miss you! I want to see you now!</b>

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.830
<b>Why must you already be looking toward tomorrow?</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:06.210
<b>Don't just brush it off, saying the time has slipped by.</b>

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.540
<b>Once more...</b>

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:14.550
<b>I love you, and yet it's been too late since long ago.</b>

00:01:14.550 --> 00:01:19.140
<b>Even if I give up, it can't be like the past.</b>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:24.350
<b>Don't just decide so simply there's no way, no choice.</b>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:28.230
<b>Smile once more.</b>

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.470
Professor Denton?

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:37.860
Hello?

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.120
Professor Denton wanted to 
know if you were here with me.

00:01:43.460 --> 00:01:44.240
Hello?

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:54.540
So, what did you want to talk with us about?

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:56.970
Mr. Hughes, Professor Denton?

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.640
Well, it's kind of...

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:04.050
With the help of the NIA, I've 
looked into a bunch of things,

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:06.600
and we've confirmed we 
have a bit of a problem...

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:08.000
A problem?

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.100
What do you mean by that?

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.320
They're connected.

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:15.270
Everything is.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:37.510
I'm getting a strong response...

00:02:37.900 --> 00:02:39.700
How did they come so far so fast?

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.560
I must hurry!

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:56.240
Connected?

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:57.780
Yes, they are.

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.440
Including what happened 
last time at the coal mine.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:04.200
As well as the series of incidents 
caused by your friend.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.620
B-Busted...

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:11.290
Furthermore, the accident on the 
island was not unrelated either.

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:14.130
That vine monster?

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:18.600
Joey, I bet you've already 
got a hunch about it, right?

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.150
About the thing that connects 
all these incidents...

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:23.750
It's...

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:27.090
...the remnants of the Skrugg!

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:29.730
Hey, hold it a second!

00:03:30.300 --> 00:03:33.390
It's true that the monsters in the 
coal mine resembled the Skrugg,

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:36.400
but didn't Joey and Heroman 
already defeat Kogorr?

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.400
Yes, Kogorr has been defeated.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.490
But that explosion didn't 
wipe out everything.

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:50.950
The ones that Will is destroying 
and that I had are examples.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:54.520
Well, what are you going to do, really?

00:03:54.520 --> 00:04:00.200
Anyone would be interested in this 
hyper-technology, not just scientists...

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.050
Stop making excuses.

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.760
So then, Will was...

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.340
Yes. His goal is to destroy 
the remnants of the Skrugg.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:12.910
He must be trying to accomplish 
something by doing that, yes?

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:17.900
I cannot allow traces of the 
Skrugg to be left on this planet.

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:21.240
What you see with your 
eyes is not everything.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.900
Things have already begun to 
move underneath the surface.

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:29.410
In other words, Will is not our enemy.

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.450
Thank goodness.

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:34.360
You won't like what's coming next, though.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:40.410
Because crisis is encroaching 
on the world this very second.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:11.490
Preparations are complete.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:17.050
All that's left is to take it back...

00:05:20.700 --> 00:05:22.370
What do you mean, crisis?

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:24.630
Who is it, and what are they trying to do?

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.560
I don't have firm answers 
to everything, of course.

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:34.810
But it's only natural to think that the 
remnants of the Skrugg are trying something big.

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:42.150
Otherwise there'd be no other explanation 
for the people kidnapped at the coal mine.

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:43.320
That was the Skrugg?

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:44.690
Yeah...

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:48.950
It's just a guess, but I think what went 
on there was some sort of experiment.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:53.160
And I'm thinking that the monsters 
that showed up were somehow connected.

00:05:53.610 --> 00:05:57.920
Actually, similar incidents 
occurred all throughout the US.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:04.170
And that's exactly why we must find out the 
truth behind what's going on without delay.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.980
If not, we'll be in real trouble!

00:06:11.230 --> 00:06:12.380
It begins.

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:17.300
We'll show them who the true 
rulers of this planet are!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:20.560
All that's left is to take it back.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:12.510
Those are...

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:13.640
Skrugg!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:16.280
What are you doing? Open fire!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.040
Is it here?

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:31.630
Do it.

00:07:54.630 --> 00:07:56.450
Mr. President!

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.630
What is it?

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.410
Take shelter immediately.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:02.250
Take shelter?

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:04.460
What in the world is going on?

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.710
There's been an accident in the bunker.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:10.140
Or more accurately, I don't know 
if it's an accident or something else.

00:08:10.140 --> 00:08:11.600
What are you talking about?

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:14.300
The bunker shouldn't be in operation now...

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.300
So then why did an accident happen?

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.820
The details can wait, sir. First evacuate!

00:08:19.820 --> 00:08:22.550
No, you explain yourself first.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:23.350
Well...

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.190
What's this?

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:34.970
Those are...

00:08:50.810 --> 00:08:52.310
I'm too late?

00:08:53.490 --> 00:08:55.090
No, it's not over yet!

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:04.640
I'll stop them, no matter the cost!

00:09:08.630 --> 00:09:13.280
Anyway, we'll investigate 
what they are trying to do.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:16.560
If you figure anything 
out, please contact us.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:17.260
Right.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:19.700
This is Hughes.

00:09:21.650 --> 00:09:22.240
What?!

00:09:23.710 --> 00:09:25.270
Understood. I'll be there soon.

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:27.900
It seems we're too late!

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.380
What happened?

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:33.380
The White House has been 
taken over by the Skrugg!

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:37.890
It seems it was a large scale attack.

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:41.070
We've already lost communications 
with the White House.

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.930
Get a helicopter ready.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.040
You'll come with us?

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.060
Of course.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:53.110
This battle may determine the fate of the United States.

00:09:53.450 --> 00:09:55.010
I'd like you to keep that in mind.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.290
Yes...

00:09:56.290 --> 00:09:57.640
Then we should also...

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:01.350
No, we'd just be holding Joey 
back if we went with him.

00:10:01.840 --> 00:10:04.680
And there's something else 
that we should be doing.

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:06.620
Like what?

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.170
I'm not saying we should sit on our hands.

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.870
Then, what?

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.710
I have an idea.

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.780
Will you help me?

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:18.290
Well, I 'spose I could...

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:19.060
Um...

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.220
What is it?

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.950
How long do I have?

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.560
How much time until we leave?

00:10:31.870 --> 00:10:35.340
60 minutes. Get ready by then.

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.090
Okay!

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:39.200
Hey, Joey! Where are you...

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:41.420
Get a clue, Psy.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.060
Now, we should also get prepared.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:57.240
I won't waver any longer.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:10:59.700
I can do this!

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:12.610
Lina, there's something I have to tell you!

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:30.310
<i>The mysterious creatures that 
invaded the White House</i>

00:11:30.310 --> 00:11:32.590
<i>are even now still increasing their numbers.</i>

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:37.550
<i>We've received information that all 
communications from the White House have ceased</i>

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:41.050
<i>but there has still been no official 
statement from the government.</i>

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:45.030
What's going on? Why the White House?

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:47.300
This is only a rumor,

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:50.600
but I've heard that the bunker under 
the White House isn't just a shelter,

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.750
it's also an unofficial research laboratory.

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:56.900
Like that island...

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.900
They're an independent research organization,

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:05.050
so I heard that neither the NIA or even the 
President himself know of its existence.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.410
So it's a remnant of the 
Skrugg, as we thought.

00:12:10.430 --> 00:12:15.390
Until we can get rid of it, there's no 
way to ensure the President's safety.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.850
I hope we make it in time.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:55.940
<i>Yes?</i>

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:56.700
Lina?

00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:58.390
<i>Joey?</i>

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:01.690
Yeah. Do you... have a sec?

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:07.390
<i>Yes. I have something I 
want to talk about, too.</i>

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:20.450
Lina...

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:22.240
Lina.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:27.370
I met my brother.

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:29.120
Will?

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:33.490
He said that he met you and the others.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:38.300
Why didn't you tell me?

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:40.480
That's because...

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:43.170
I always believed in you.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:45.590
No! It's because...

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:51.070
I thought that it would be really 
bad if you found out then.

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:53.350
Bad? Why?

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.520
Are you saying that my 
brother did something wrong?

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:58.940
No! You see, it was all a misunderstanding!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.600
I don't want to hear your excuses!

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:03.200
Lina...

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:04.070
Go home.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:07.650
I don't want to see your 
face right now, Joey.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:36.150
Lina!

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:43.500
I... I...

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.610
I'll definitely...

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.790
I'll definitely...

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:53.690
...definitely protect you!

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:55.450
Huh? What?

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:07.700
Wait!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:08.920
What did you say?

00:15:09.260 --> 00:15:10.420
I can't hear you!

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:12.540
Joey!

00:15:13.620 --> 00:15:15.910
Joey!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:26.750
Are you okay?

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.690
Yes.

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:31.200
I don't have any regrets anymore.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:34.740
Or rather, I'm fully prepared.

00:15:36.210 --> 00:15:38.790
So, what should I do now?

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:40.330
Read this.

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:45.780
After we get to the airport, we'll take 
a private flight to Washington D.C.

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:50.500
Take the time we're in the air to 
look through all that information.

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:55.550
NIA's tactical team have also come up 
with a number of simulations you can use.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:00.630
You'll have whatever backup we can provide.

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:05.810
If there's anything you need, we'll 
get it immediately. Just ask.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:08.450
Thank you very much.

00:16:09.850 --> 00:16:13.770
And there's one more thing... A 
present NIA has prepared for you.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:27.270
This is...

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:31.460
NIA developed it at the 
direction of Mr. Denton.

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:35.050
I'm sure it'll come in handy.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:39.980
Are you sure about this?

00:18:39.980 --> 00:18:41.900
<i>Yes, we don't have any time.</i>

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:44.790
<i>Please get me as close to 
the center as possible!</i>

00:18:44.790 --> 00:18:45.890
Roger that.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.970
Got it? Hold the plane steady!

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:51.850
Lower our speed as much as 
you can and drop them off!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:54.690
Understood, but I can't guarantee anything!

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:56.500
Give it everything you've got!

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.890
Opening rear bay doors!

00:19:25.510 --> 00:19:27.220
A new ability...

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:32.550
Plus power armor that the 
Professor helped create...

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:41.550
It'll be okay. I can do this.

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:44.750
Are you ready, Heroman?

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:00.540
Those are...

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.590
No one said they could do that!

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:08.620
Keep it up!

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.070
Don't go down until we 
drop off Joey and Heroman!

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:12.310
This is nuts!

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:13.450
<i>Mr. Hughes!</i>

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:14.390
What is it?

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:15.770
<i>Please don't overdo it.</i>

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:18.150
<i>There's no point if you and the 
others get wrapped up in the battle!</i>

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.470
Don't be silly!

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:20.740
The least we can do is...

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:21.790
<i>I'm going.</i>

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:23.570
Wait, Joey!

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.360
Damn it... Find some open ground!

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:27.460
National Airport!

00:20:27.460 --> 00:20:28.910
Head there!

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:37.030
Heroman... Go!

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:41.740
We're counting on you, Joey, Heroman!

00:21:56.620 --> 00:21:58.410
I knew it...

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:06.210
Their goal... is to resurrect Kogorr!

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:32.400
<b>I want to get to know you better,</b>

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:35.490
<b>to go at each other with our true feelings.</b>

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:41.830
<b>Your tears and smile are both here.</b>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.260
<b>No matter how hard it is, I won't be scared any more.</b>

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:49.320
<b>With both of us, we can go anywhere.</b>

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:54.760
<b>Since you're the one who taught me that I'm not alone.</b>

00:22:54.760 --> 00:23:02.450
<b>Every time I mutter the words "I was born to meet you"</b>

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:07.490
<b>my unease disappears, and my heart burns stronger.</b>

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:14.440
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:19.300
<b>Carve out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:23.840
<b>I can't move away from here.</b>

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:28.060
<b>Because I live feeling the same heartbeat.</b>

00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:30.280
<b>I want to protect you to the very last,</b>

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:32.680
<b>to protect the promise built up.</b>

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:40.080
<b>Thank you. We'll go on together with a sign only we understand.</b>

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:45.810
<b>We are carving out this irreplaceable time!</b>

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:52.740
On the next Heroman:

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:57.530
Heroman's battle strength should be increased 
by the power armor that the Professor developed.

00:23:57.530 --> 00:24:00.850
This is a battle that I can't afford to lose!

00:24:00.850 --> 00:24:03.400
The White House, now turned 
into a Skrugg base,

00:24:03.400 --> 00:24:05.790
continues to envelope the 
city and grow in size...

00:24:06.050 --> 00:24:09.500
The remnants of the Skrugg 
have only one goal...

00:24:09.500 --> 00:24:11.730
To resurrect Kogorr!

00:24:12.390 --> 00:24:16.010
Next time on Heroman #24: Resurrection.

00:24:16.010 --> 00:24:18.720
Heroman... Attack!
